OL,3,ATax on banks, energy bill help and
OL,4,Aminimum wage rise - what could be in
OL,5,Athe Budget?
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey will set out
OL,8,FLabour's tax and spending plans when he
OL,9,Fdelivers his first Budget on Wednesday.
OL,11,FHe and Prime Minister Andy Burnham are
OL,12,Fhoping to give households "breathing
OL,13,Fspace" amid the ongoing high cost of
OL,14,Fliving.
OL,16,FBut Healey has also refused to rule out
OL,17,Fsome tax increases to potentially pay
OL,18,Ffor support he could distribute
OL,19,Felsewhere.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
